# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:10
translate italian mills1_de9fb575:

    # "As soon as I go into Mrs. Mills office to start working, I know something is wrong."
    "Non appena entro nell’ufficio della signora Mills per iniziare a lavorare, capisco subito che c’è qualcosa che non va."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:12
translate italian mills1_46eab517:

    # "Mrs. Mills stands up from her desk and walks up to me as soon as I shut the door."
    "La signora Mills si alza dalla scrivania e mi viene incontro non appena chiudo la porta."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:13
translate italian mills1_9720edc3:

    # bs "Look [pcname], you have a lot of work to do today."
    bs "Senti [pcname], oggi hai un sacco di lavoro da sbrigare."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:14
translate italian mills1_9c04a9df:

    # bs "So I don't want you just jerking off like you have been."
    bs "Quindi non voglio che te ne stia lì a bighellonare come hai fatto finora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:15
translate italian mills1_60630d5f:

    # bs "No sitting around chatting, no flirting with Dana, no staring at me when you think I'm not looking."
    bs "Niente chiacchiere, niente flirt con Dana, niente sguardi fissi su di me quando pensi che non ti stia guardando."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:16
translate italian mills1_1e9feafd:

    # bs "You've been slacking off around here and I'm tired of it."
    bs "Hai bighellonato qui e ne ho abbastanza."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:17
translate italian mills1_bd4fb3de:

    # bs "So clean up this office. I want it cleaner than it has ever been."
    bs "Quindi pulisci questo ufficio. Lo voglio più pulito che mai."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:18
translate italian mills1_27d60d0e:

    # bs "I want to see you on your knees, getting all the dust out of the corners and polishing every inch of this place."
    bs "Voglio vederti in ginocchio, a togliere tutta la polvere dagli angoli e a lucidare ogni centimetro di questo posto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:21
translate italian mills1_f9906f0b:

    # "I grab my supplies and immediately go to work."
    "Prendo i miei attrezzi e mi metto subito al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:23
translate italian mills1_641fb955:

    # bs "I already told you what you did wrong. You're lazy and I'm tired of you taking advantage of my kind nature."
    bs "Ti ho già detto cosa hai sbagliato. Sei pigro e sono stanca che tu approfitti della mia gentilezza."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:25
translate italian mills1_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/mills_nowgettowork1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_nowgettowork1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:26
translate italian mills1_af024200:

    # bs "Now get to work."
    bs "Ora mettiti al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:29
translate italian mills1_602e4e0a:

    # bs "Oh is it?"
    bs "Ah sì?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:30
translate italian mills1_5e887178:

    # bs "Is it bullshit?"
    bs "È una stronzata?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:31
translate italian mills1_8273c1c7:

    # bs "What I think is bullshit is my paid intern talking back to me when I told him to perform a job."
    bs "Quello che penso sia una stronzata è che il mio stagista pagato mi risponda male quando gli dico di svolgere un lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:32
translate italian mills1_f88c2e68:

    # bs "Do you want me to fire you?"
    bs "Vuoi che ti licenzi?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:33
translate italian mills1_a4adeba2:

    # "I think about it for a moment. I don't want to be treated like this, but I also need the money and am not sure if I'd be able to get another job easily."
    "Ci penso un attimo. Non voglio essere trattato così, ma ho anche bisogno di soldi e non sono sicuro di riuscire a trovare facilmente un altro lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:34
translate italian mills1_e842297d:

    # "Especially one where I get a free car out of the deal."
    "Soprattutto uno in cui mi danno un’auto gratis."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:35
translate italian mills1_9abd97c5:

    # pc "No ma'am."
    pc "No, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:36
translate italian mills1_0f684137:

    # bs "Then quit your back-talk and get to work."
    bs "Allora smettila di rispondere male e mettiti al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:38
translate italian mills1_196ecdb4:

    # "I get to work cleaning everything, scrubbing every surface in the place, dusting the corners like she had said."
    "Mi metto al lavoro a pulire tutto, strofinando ogni superficie del locale, spolverando gli angoli come mi aveva detto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:40
translate italian mills1_014d684e:

    # "I'm not sure that she is actually getting any work done while I am cleaning."
    "Non sono sicura che lei stia effettivamente lavorando mentre io pulisco."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:41
translate italian mills1_04589ea8:

    # "To me, it seems like she just sits there and watches me the whole time."
    "A me sembra che se ne stia semplicemente seduta lì a guardarmi per tutto il tempo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:42
translate italian mills1_e02d88e1:

    # bs "Be sure you get that spot over there."
    bs "Assicurati di pulire bene quel punto laggiù."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:43
translate italian mills1_6b79327c:

    # bs "If there's a single bit of dirt left over there later, I'm going to be very upset, [pcname]."
    bs "Se più tardi rimarrà anche solo un granello di sporco lì, mi arrabbierò tantissimo, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:44
translate italian mills1_27eb9444:

    # "I work like that for four hours, non-stop, until the office is closed and it is time to go home."
    "Lavoro così per quattro ore, senza sosta, finché l’ufficio non chiude ed è ora di tornare a casa."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:46
translate italian mills1_e2dee895:

    # bs "Alright, stud, you can stop."
    bs "Va bene, campione, puoi smettere."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:47
translate italian mills1_53e9c55a:

    # bs "Stand up."
    bs "Alzati in piedi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:51
translate italian mills1_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/mills_didgoodwork.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_didgoodwork.mp3'

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:52
translate italian mills1_2ca78f08:

    # bs "You did good work today."
    bs "Oggi hai fatto un ottimo lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:53
translate italian mills1_fe3292c7:

    # bs "Honestly, you do good work most days."
    bs "Onestamente, quasi tutti i giorni fai un ottimo lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:54
translate italian mills1_a79bb6dc:

    # bs "I was in a bit of a bad mood earlier and took it out on you a little."
    bs "Prima ero un po’ di cattivo umore e me la sono presa un po’ con te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:55
translate italian mills1_cfb2e357:

    # bs "Sorry about that."
    bs "Mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:56
translate italian mills1_be77b030:

    # bs "But seeing you on your knees working your ass off for me definitely made me feel better."
    bs "Ma vederti in ginocchio a darti da fare per me mi ha decisamente fatto sentire meglio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:58
translate italian mills1_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/mills_thankyou2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/mills_thankyou2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:59
translate italian mills1_66fe2ea0:

    # bs "Thank you for that."
    bs "Grazie mille."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:60
translate italian mills1_aa5ddb1f:

    # bs "Anyway, go on home. Thanks for working so hard today."
    bs "Comunque, vai a casa. Grazie per aver lavorato così sodo oggi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:61
translate italian mills1_1ca80c77:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:63
translate italian mills1_1f470382:

    # "I leave her office and head down to the lobby."
    "Esco dal suo ufficio e mi dirigo verso l’atrio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:64
translate italian mills1_f1b20649:

    # "Dana had already left. I hadn't even seen her all day after work started."
    "Dana se n’era già andata. Non l’avevo nemmeno vista per tutto il giorno dopo l’inizio del lavoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:65
translate italian mills1_880f4fbb:

    # "Mrs. Mills had just wanted to see me on the floor. She seems to like that feeling of domination."
    "La signora Mills aveva solo voluto vedermi in ufficio. Sembra che le piaccia quella sensazione di dominio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:69
translate italian mills1_94c66083:

    # "I have to admit, having her dominate me like that is pretty fucking hot."
    "Devo ammetterlo, farmi dominare da lei in quel modo è davvero eccitante, cazzo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:70
translate italian mills1_947d9cb0:

    # "I wonder how far she would take it."
    "Mi chiedo fino a che punto si spingerebbe."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:73
translate italian mills1_c7f17ec1:

    # "I don't like this at all. I don't want anything to do with her."
    "Non mi piace affatto questa situazione. Non voglio avere nulla a che fare con lei."

# game/Scenes/MrsMills/mills1.rpy:74
translate italian mills1_1180df5a:

    # "This isn't going to go any further."
    "La cosa non andrà oltre."

